# Keeps the binaries/ directory in a fresh checkout so tauri.conf.json's
# externalBin path ("binaries/bossclawd") resolves at bundle time. The actual
# target-triple-suffixed sidecar (bossclawd-<triple>) is a build artifact staged
# by scripts/dev-build-signed.sh (and by release CI) — never committed. See
# scripts/install-bossclawd.sh for the co-signing requirement.
